# Noniterative Factor Analysis Estimators, with Algorithms for Subset and Instrumental Variable Selection.

**Authors:** Cudeck, Robert

## Abstract
Two algorithms that automatically select subsets of variables (PACE algorithm) and reference variables (Fabin estimators), respectively, used for the noniterative estimators are presented. The PACE algorithm is based on a nonsymmetric matrix sweep operator. A Monte Carlo experiment compares the relative performance of these estimators and others. (TJH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ423882

